# "Search your library for a basic land card": a Tundra in the library is a land with basic land types but not a basic land card
# (CR 205.4a), so it may not be found (a refusal), while the Plains beside it may - the positive control. Bot1 sacrifices Fabled
# Passage with only two other lands, so the Plains comes in tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Fabled Passage
Island x4
Island
Island
Tundra
Plains
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Tundra)
Bot1.Search(Plains)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Plains
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Fabled Passage
